<title>POLAND: IZOLACJA INCREASES LOSS IN Q1.</title>
<headline>IZOLACJA INCREASES LOSS IN Q1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Izolacja preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			   1.20 vs	1.01</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			     1.20 vs	1.01</p>
<p>    net loss				   1.20 vs	1.01</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Izolacja SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 12.32 vs	6.17</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  13.52 vs	7.42</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
