<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.34 vs	0.13</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.34 vs	0.13</p>
<p>    investment				 1.74 vs	0.36</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
